🔹 Formula

For an inductor:

V = L × (di/dt)

So,

L = V × dt / di

Where:

L = Inductance in Henry (H)
V = Voltage in Volts (V)
dt = Change in time in seconds (s)
di = Change in current in Amperes (A)

